WEBVTT

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:03.120
Boss, here's today's sales report...

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:16.900
Robbers! Everybody, get down!

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:18.590
No! Let me go!

00:01:26.010 --> 00:01:28.050
Want a blast? Step right up!

00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:29.270
I'm giving them away as presents!

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:56.050
Damn!

00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:01.140
What's this?

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:02.790
Nothing but ten dollar bills?!

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:04.180
What the hell were
you thinking of?

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:06.640
Cops! Hey! Do something!

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:08.100
Didn't you hear me?

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:16.110
Hey, will we be all right?

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:17.400
There's more of them coming!

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.860
We'll take the prearranged route.

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:22.220
Unit 52, currently in pursuit of suspect vehicle.

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:24.260
Approaching Dearborn, over.

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:26.540
Roger. Maintain pursuit.

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:28.000
I'll lose them!

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.120
What the hell's this?

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:39.770
Well, how do you like that?

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:41.480
Cut the comedy!

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:42.340
Change course!

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:43.550
Break through that fence!

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:45.520
You should be able to get to the other side!

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:47.830
Don't worry about hitting him!

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:49.810
We'll sandwich him with that trailer!

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:20.110
What were you looking at, you jerk?!

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:21.280
<i>They're all trashed! Damn!</i>

00:03:20.110 --> 00:03:21.280
Get that thing out of the way!

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:23.640
We gotta get after them!

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:25.060
I just knew it'd be the Roadbuster!

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:26.140
Dammit!

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:29.150
$45 thousand... exactly.

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:31.230
Hold on a sec!

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:34.560
Got a problem?

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:37.280
With what we made this
time, that's unfair!

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:39.790
Not getting enough is your
problem, not mine.

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:41.920
I did my part.

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:43.630
I'm taking what we agreed upon.

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:45.050
Hey! The next job–

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:46.070
No thanks!

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:48.240
You're such amateurs that it's doubtful
whether you'd earn my shipping fees.

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:52.990
Besides, I'm through working for dumb
jerks who use kids as accomplices!

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:00.240
Come on, get in!

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:12.000
Let's go.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:12.880
Okay!

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:53.620
Bean?

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:54.590
You in there?

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:55.740
Here I come!

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:03.150
Wake up, Bean!

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:04.680
It's 10:30 already!

00:05:04.680 --> 00:05:05.640
Bean!

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:33.150
Well? Are you awake now?

00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:38.580
Rally, your wake-up technique
leaves a lot to be desired!

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:40.480
Were you planning
to fry my eyeball?

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:43.710
You didn't wake up when
I used the stun gun!

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.730
So anyway, how'd it go last night?

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:47.200
Did you get the money okay?

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:48.670
Uh-huh.

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:53.540
But I've had enough of that trigger-happy airhead and his pint-sized partner.

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:56.800
So what's our schedule for
the rest of the week?

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:00.000
Never mind the week; there's
nothing on for the month.

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:01.490
Huh?

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:05.190
I tell you, even our $40 thousand
minimum fee is too expensive.

00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:08.260
Unless we lower our prices and
get more jobs, we can't go on.

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:09.960
Our prices aren't the issue.

00:06:09.960 --> 00:06:12.890
Our problem is that
we can't advertise.

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:17.940
Is the wiretap on the police
phone still in place?

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:20.400
Yeah, but there's nothing
interesting on it.

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:26.490
Could that be...

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:28.670
a customer?

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:30.160
I wish...

00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:31.830
Who's there?

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:33.050
I have a delivery request.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:34.070
Please let me in!

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:36.140
This ain't UPS, fella!

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:37.760
This is a request for
the Roadbuster!

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:39.120
Please let me in!

00:06:39.510 --> 00:06:40.840
I'm not the police!

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:43.660
Hang on a sec.

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:48.220
Please help us!

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:49.630
We've just escaped from
a gang of kidnappers!

00:06:55.950 --> 00:06:56.990
Inspector!

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:57.640
Eh...?

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.520
The Chief wants you.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:00.670
Oh, all right.

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:02.070
Hmm, that's a nice car.

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:03.350
Is it a Mustang?

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:06.740
No, a Cobra!

00:07:06.740 --> 00:07:09.080
A Shelby Cobra GT-500!

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:11.820
With this, I'll run that damn
Roadbuster right off the road!

00:07:12.350 --> 00:07:16.290
With a Shelby engine, souped up
to 355 hp, it's one big machine!

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.810
Maximum torque, 58 kilos!

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:23.170
She's got Goodyear Eagle tyres
and B. B. Stein shocks!

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:26.000
That Roadbuster's finally
going to be busted!

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:30.070
That slime ball's trashed
74 police cars!

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:32.090
This time he'll pay!

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:37.920
The Chief's on the
fourth floor?

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:39.060
Y-Yes, sir.

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:43.230
What can I do for you, Chief?

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:46.350
Percy! Could you open doors
quietly, for a change?

00:07:46.350 --> 00:07:48.190
You sent for me just
to tell me that?

00:07:48.580 --> 00:07:50.450
No, for work, you dummy!

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:53.410
That Roadbuster case you're
always working on...

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:56.980
Leave it to me!

00:07:56.980 --> 00:08:00.120
I've finally found a car that can take his out.

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:01.690
You can forget about it for now.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.200
Two days ago...

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:07.780
the daughter of the president of the
Grimwood Company was kidnapped.

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:09.590
Get on the case!

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:11.450
You've got to be kidding!

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:13.740
Why do I have to work on a
lousy kidnapping case?

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:15.440
What do you mean, “lousy”?

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:19.780
Do you know how much tax the Grimwood
Conglomerate pays this city?

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:24.760
If the kid gets killed,
the mayor will have our heads.

00:08:24.760 --> 00:08:27.310
Then you won't be able
to go after that courier.

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:29.780
What have we got?

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:33.690
Chelsea Grimwood. Age 11.

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:36.470
Last seen the evening of the 14th.

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:38.720
So, uh...

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:39.740
Morris.

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:41.910
Okay, Mr. Morris...

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:45.830
why didn't you just go straight
home, or run to the cops?

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:50.550
They seem to be a big organisation,

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:53.700
and may have infiltrated the police.

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:56.340
I couldn't possibly get Miss
Grimwood to the mansion.

00:08:57.310 --> 00:08:59.760
It was a miracle that
we made it here.

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:03.060
Please! Take us to the
mansion in your car.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:05.290
You'll be paid a more
than adequate fee.

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:08.020
How'd you know about this office?

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:11.530
The Grimwood Conglomerate also
has an intelligence agency.

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:13.990
You're already a
well-known figure there.

00:09:14.770 --> 00:09:16.410
Bean! It's true.

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:19.260
They were talking about
it on the police line.

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:20.910
This was recorded
ten minutes ago.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:24.440
<i>She's probably been spirited away
into the kiddie-porn underground.</i>

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:27.200
<i>She's Grimwood's daughter,
and 11 years old to boot!</i>

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:28.960
<i>The perverts will be
drooling over her!</i>

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:32.170
<i>Don't get so upset. Why don't you
go to the meetings or something?</i>

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:34.990
<i>You know I don't like conducting
investigations like that!</i>

00:09:34.990 --> 00:09:36.930
<i>You'd only have to show up!</i>

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:40.230
My man Percy!

00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:42.870
For 50 grand, you've got a deal.

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:45.000
You'll take it?

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:47.440
Cash in full, on arrival.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:48.150
Of course!

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:18.310
Is he dead?

00:10:18.310 --> 00:10:21.140
He'd have to be a zombie to be
alive with his brains blown out.

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:22.060
What about the girl?

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.040
Over there.

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:26.600
I kicked the chair over before
the glass blew out.

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:28.930
She didn't catch
a single shot!

00:10:28.930 --> 00:10:30.500
She's still asleep!

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:33.290
They must have given her
a really potent drug.

00:10:34.550 --> 00:10:36.190
Bean, are you all right?

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:39.780
Oh, I'm so glad you're
concerned about me!

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:56.980
There, perfect condition!

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:01.300
Rally! Where's the tape?

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:04.050
<i>I am Morris Grey,</i>

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:06.430
<i>a bodyguard
of the Grimwood family.</i>

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:08.630
<i>As you are a first-class
courier, I'd like to ask–</i>

00:11:08.630 --> 00:11:11.960
It'll be difficult getting them to
trust us with just this tape.

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:13.190
I wonder if we can get
them to pay up?

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:18.470
Well, 50 grand might be a bit steep,
so it'll depend on their response.

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:21.000
If they think we kidnapped her,
or we screw up somehow...

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.980
we'll just drop off
the kid and split.

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:25.740
You're being awfully gentle
about this. What's wrong?

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:29.000
Child abductions just aren't
my strong suit, you know.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:32.540
Hey, you don't suppose those gunmen
were part of the kidnapping group?

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:35.430
But they just started shooting, without
trying to get their hostages back...

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:36.870
Strange, isn't it?

00:11:36.870 --> 00:11:38.750
Is anyone else mad at you?

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:39.470
Loads of people.

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:43.200
Bean! What're we going
to do about our client?

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:44.550
I'll call the Fixer later on.

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:11.640
What?

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:12.430
You're putting me on!

00:12:12.430 --> 00:12:15.560
Well, the manager of the Ontario
Warehouse gave us the tip.

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:16.340
Is it really him?

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:19.300
It seems a security camera
picked it up...

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:23.510
Here!

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:25.800
The Roadbuster!

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:28.360
Yes, but you'll never guess
who was in the back seat!

00:12:28.360 --> 00:12:31.070
Look what the computer
enlargement shows!

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:32.900
H-Hey, that's!

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:35.850
Yes, Chelsea Grimwood. No doubt
about it. Outfit's the same, too.

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:40.040
It's a sure bet the Roadbuster
is involved in the kidnapping.

00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:42.510
I see!

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:45.110
We can go after him
with impunity!

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:46.760
Good work!

00:12:50.340 --> 00:12:52.290
Just you wait, Roadbuster!

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:54.630
I'll finish you off for sure.

00:12:54.630 --> 00:12:57.500
I'll run you over until your
brains spill out!

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:06.720
How are you feeling, Mr. Grimwood?

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:09.170
Not good.

00:13:09.170 --> 00:13:09.930
Terrible.

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:12.080
You take mustard?

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:13.680
Yes, plenty.

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:14.570
Can I ask you something...?

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:15.200
What?

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:18.900
My daughter, Chelsea...
you'll return her safely, right?

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:22.540
I'd imagine that she's either at home
or with the police by now.

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:23.730
I see...

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:25.980
Would you let me watch
TV or listen to the radio?

00:13:25.980 --> 00:13:28.580
No way! Semmer will
get mad at me.

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:30.620
Exactly what is she to you?

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:32.200
She's my lover!

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:36.280
H-How old are you, anyway?

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:38.910
It's not polite to ask a lady her age!

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:40.660
Anyway, hurry up and eat.

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:42.880
We're leaving here right after
Semmer gets back.

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.050
Uh, just a moment...

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:46.510
Uh... no, never mind.

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:49.220
Uh, just a sec...

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:50.220
What?!

00:13:50.820 --> 00:13:52.830
No, this is for real.

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:54.520
I need to go to the bathroom.

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:57.260
Semmer's got the key to your leg
cuffs, if that's what you want.

00:13:57.260 --> 00:14:01.160
Well, I can wait on No. 2, but I can't
hold off on No. 1 much longer.

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:02.030
No problem.

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:04.080
There's a porta-potty under the table.

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:08.870
Uh...

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:11.270
Would you step outside
for a moment?

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:13.620
But you'll have a hard time
with those cuffs on.

00:14:14.310 --> 00:14:15.580
Shall I help?

00:14:17.110 --> 00:14:19.040
No, that's all right.

00:14:19.360 --> 00:14:22.250
No! We can't have you making
a mess on the carpet.

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:24.520
Let me help you.

00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:27.950
No, no, I still haven't had a
shower today. I'm filthy.

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:30.220
Then I'll clean it up!

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:31.450
H-Hey, you!

00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:34.210
It's okay. I'm great at it.

00:14:34.210 --> 00:14:36.400
Semmer always praises me.

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:38.770
Stop it!

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:41.440
Uh, sorry...

00:14:42.460 --> 00:14:43.550
What'd you do that for?

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:45.250
I was just being nice!

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:46.900
How'd you like me to slice it off?

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:49.360
Little girls shouldn't
do things like that.

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:50.940
Don't preach to me, old man!

00:14:50.940 --> 00:14:53.830
You've done terrible things behind
your nice-papa act, haven't you?

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:55.470
You don't understand.

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:58.330
Nobody gets rich by
being a nice guy!

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.850
Did she tell you that?

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:02.790
Yes! She tells me all the time!

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:05.000
And you believe what that thug tells–

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:07.760
“That thug”, you called me?

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:12.260
Among my acquaintances,
I'm considered a lady!

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:13.720
Semmer!

00:15:14.370 --> 00:15:16.360
Welcome back!

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:16.360
<i>Hello, Carrie...</i>

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:18.430
is what I want to say, but...

00:15:19.190 --> 00:15:23.100
I wonder if you're not being overly
hospitable to our hostage.

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:25.150
Uh-oh... you saw that...

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:26.840
Don't you dare...

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:28.280
try to put one over on me...

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.820
you little slut!

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:31.780
Stop it!

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:35.430
I'm... I'm sorry...

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:37.780
Mistress...

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:40.770
Maybe I haven't been
hard enough on you.

00:15:40.770 --> 00:15:44.060
I'm sorry. I won't do it anymore,
I promise, so please...

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:45.670
If you do anything
like this again...

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:46.880
Stop it!

00:15:48.700 --> 00:15:51.700
I'll obey your every word, Mistress...

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:53.260
Please forgive me...

00:15:57.460 --> 00:15:59.730
All right, we're leaving.
Get your stuff together.

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:00.810
Okay!

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:03.100
You rotten bitch–

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:04.020
Now, now...

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:05.920
That's not nice.

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:08.480
Hostages shouldn't talk like that.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:10.620
My daughter...?

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:12.430
I left her with a pro.

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:15.360
With luck, she should
already be home.

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:16.110
A pro?

00:16:16.110 --> 00:16:18.940
Bean Bandit. Maybe you know of him?

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:21.460
The Roadbuster. I've heard
a lot about him.

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:24.600
Well, if he puts on his
trademark show...

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:26.920
it'll make it much easier
for us to get away.

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.550
What do you mean by–

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:31.730
I suggest that you shut up.

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:34.340
For the time being, you are
a well-paying guest...

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:35.930
so I'd hate to have to get rough.

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:38.310
Now it's departure time.

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:39.640
Come with me.

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:43.890
Who are you clowns?

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:46.130
Never mind who we are!

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:47.980
Is this the Grimwood residence?

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:48.860
Let's see some ID!

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:52.050
I came at the request of a guy
who used to be a guard here.

00:16:52.050 --> 00:16:53.220
Put me through to the Chairman.

00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:55.530
I can't put anyone through
without proof of identity!

00:16:55.530 --> 00:16:57.490
You got an appointment?

00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:01.910
Main gate!

00:17:05.630 --> 00:17:06.540
Go on through!

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:09.830
Heh. Thank you!

00:17:32.390 --> 00:17:35.010
My, my, all these nice men
gathering around us.

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:36.730
I wonder what they do when
they're not so busy?

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:38.910
Drink, smoke, watch TV, and gamble...

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:40.420
Just like the gangs.

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:43.500
Uh, testing, testing. Dear gentlemen
of the House of Grimwood!

00:17:44.010 --> 00:17:46.190
Thank you for such a magnificent reception!

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:47.720
I'm a courier.

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:49.570
I can't tell you my name
for certain reasons...

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:52.040
but I've brought Miss Chelsea here at
the request of your colleague, Morris.

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:55.580
They escaped from a
gang of kidnappers.

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:56.590
Open the door!

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:58.140
Let Miss Chelsea out now!

00:17:58.770 --> 00:18:01.350
Unlock your door and put
your hands on your head!

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:04.060
I'm going to play a testimonial tape now.

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:07.520
<i>I'm Morris Grey, a bodyguard
for the Grimwood Family–</i>

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:12.640
Inspector! The Roadbuster's
at the Grimwood Estate!

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:23.480
Hey! Who's covering the
Grimwood place now?

00:18:23.480 --> 00:18:24.900
Akira and Terry, sir.

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:25.900
Ha!

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:28.180
Those bozos!

00:18:28.180 --> 00:18:31.170
But why would he show up <i>there</i>?

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:33.640
Word is he brought the
Chelsea girl with him!

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:34.650
What?!

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:36.970
Keep your eyes on
the road, please!

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:38.310
What's he up to?

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:39.130
I don't know!

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:43.720
Don't tell me the ransom has
been paid out already...

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.310
Come on! Move it!

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:55.780
<i>Cash, in full, on arrival.</i>

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:56.940
<i>Of course!</i>

00:18:57.900 --> 00:19:00.200
And that's it. 50 grand,
just like the man said.

00:19:01.760 --> 00:19:03.660
Is that all you got to say?

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:06.580
There are no guards
here named Morris.

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.000
Where's the Chairman
and the money?

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:13.090
I don't follow you.

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:15.300
Mr. George Grimwood, the Chairman!

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:18.640
He took $2 million to make the trade
with you bastards this morning!

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:19.880
Er... Well...

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:21.450
Enough! We can talk later.

00:19:21.450 --> 00:19:23.430
Right now, get out
of that junkheap!

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:25.700
What the hell...

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:26.850
What did you just say?

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:30.040
I said, get out of that piece
of crap car, now!

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:31.920
That's one hell of a clunker
you're driving!

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:36.690
Bean!

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:37.230
Move it!

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:41.040
What are you putting on
your seat belt for?

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:41.700
Get out, punk!

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:43.080
Move it, I said!

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:47.660
Don't get smart with me!

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:52.620
Bulletproof!

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:55.090
Damn piece of crap!

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:11.310
Piece of crap?

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:12.600
Junkheap?

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:13.850
The hell you say?!

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:24.660
Uh-oh!

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:26.240
Dammit!

00:20:27.760 --> 00:20:29.960
Hi! You awake, Miss?

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:31.200
Oh no!

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:38.380
<i>Oh no! Let me go! Hey, let me go!</i>

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:36.680
Miss, calm down...!

00:20:36.680 --> 00:20:37.400
Bean!

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:39.840
We tried. Now we forget the 50 grand drop her off and split.

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:39.840
<i>Save me, Papa!</i>

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:45.430
Okay, let her out!

00:20:50.530 --> 00:20:52.260
An anti-tank rifle!

00:20:52.260 --> 00:20:53.640
Get us out of here!

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:58.480
This is the Police!
Open that gate!

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:00.440
Move it!

00:21:03.220 --> 00:21:05.450
You jerks listen up! Block
that gate no matter what!

00:21:19.990 --> 00:21:22.590
Yo, Percy my man!
How's life?

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:27.360
Roadb... buster...

00:21:27.360 --> 00:21:28.940
Nice car you got there.

00:21:28.940 --> 00:21:30.090
GT-500?

00:21:30.090 --> 00:21:31.030
Yeah.

00:21:31.030 --> 00:21:35.520
I finally found just the
right car to waste you in.

00:21:35.870 --> 00:21:39.020
You mean, just right to <i>be</i>
wasted by me in, right?

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:40.030
Heh!

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:43.490
I can't believe that a bozo who's
stooped to kidnapping children...

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:46.360
still has the nerve to brag!

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:51.240
Who's kidnapping children?

00:21:51.680 --> 00:21:52.570
Shut up!

00:21:52.570 --> 00:21:55.190
I've got evidence.

00:21:55.190 --> 00:21:55.960
Hey, Dick!

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:56.920
Uh, yes, sir?

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:58.420
Show it to him.

00:21:58.780 --> 00:22:00.880
You'll get ten years
for this, at least!

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:02.580
I don't know what you're
talking about.

00:22:02.580 --> 00:22:05.550
Yeah? Then what about that
kid in your back seat?

00:22:05.550 --> 00:22:09.140
If I drop her off, they'll shoot me up
with a 20mm cannon, ya know...

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:09.760
Say what?!

00:22:12.190 --> 00:22:14.870
See? I haven't even let her out yet and
already they're firing at me.

00:22:14.870 --> 00:22:15.860
So long!

00:22:17.140 --> 00:22:18.210
After them!

00:22:18.210 --> 00:22:19.770
Oh no, the broken glass...!

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:20.650
Morons!

00:22:30.690 --> 00:22:34.480
Shouldn't we take off from O'Hare?
After all, it's the closest.

00:22:34.480 --> 00:22:35.900
Don't be an idiot!

00:22:35.900 --> 00:22:39.640
It's also the first place the bastard will check once our little deception is exposed.

00:22:39.640 --> 00:22:40.220
The bastard...?

00:22:40.220 --> 00:22:40.790
Right!

00:22:41.280 --> 00:22:43.920
He's a professional driver who's wrecked
dozens of police cars...

00:22:43.920 --> 00:22:46.760
in the process of helping
many criminals to escape!

00:22:47.240 --> 00:22:49.200
The cops aren't likely
to catch him.

00:22:49.200 --> 00:22:52.720
So he'll keep on drawing the attention
of the police away from us, right?

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:54.180
You got it.

00:22:55.060 --> 00:22:56.640
Hey, wait, wait a second!

00:22:57.010 --> 00:22:58.450
What do you think you're doing?

00:22:58.450 --> 00:23:00.600
What does it look like I'm doing?

00:23:00.600 --> 00:23:01.740
I'm going to fill 'er up.

00:23:01.740 --> 00:23:03.110
Fill 'er up?

00:23:03.110 --> 00:23:04.640
There's not much time
left before the plane leaves!

00:23:04.640 --> 00:23:06.400
I'll get it all done in fifteen minutes!

00:23:06.990 --> 00:23:08.780
I want to stock up on munchies, too.

00:23:08.780 --> 00:23:11.030
Now, hold on a moment!
We will make it, right?

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:11.990
We will, with a full tank.

00:23:23.350 --> 00:23:25.330
Welcome. May I have your–

00:23:24.120 --> 00:23:29.430
<i>Because, if we hadn't done it, we'd all have been in danger!</i>

00:23:29.430 --> 00:23:32.090
They thought we were
the kidnappers!

00:23:32.090 --> 00:23:36.370
They started shooting at us, without
giving us time to drop you off.

00:23:36.370 --> 00:23:39.090
And on top of that, they opened
up on us with a 20mm cannon!

00:23:39.090 --> 00:23:41.910
<i>Naturally, I want to get you home safely...</i>

00:23:39.730 --> 00:23:41.910
Oh, don't concern yourself.

00:23:41.910 --> 00:23:43.940
<i>but it's not possible right now, so...</i>

00:23:41.910 --> 00:23:45.400
I'll have 30 spareribs and a case of Bud.

00:23:43.940 --> 00:23:46.020
<i>please, until this is settled, help us out.</i>

00:23:45.400 --> 00:23:46.020
What about you two?

00:23:46.470 --> 00:23:47.670
Oh, I'll have a sand–

00:23:47.670 --> 00:23:49.450
Strawberry pudding and milk!

00:23:50.750 --> 00:23:52.200
So you finally talked.

00:23:52.200 --> 00:23:53.650
It's good that your stomach is honest.

00:23:53.650 --> 00:23:55.800
Add a sandwich, a strawberry
pudding and a milk, okay?

00:23:55.800 --> 00:23:58.290
Thanks! Coming right up!

00:23:58.980 --> 00:24:00.510
Now let's see...

00:24:00.510 --> 00:24:02.210
Get a load of this!

00:24:02.880 --> 00:24:04.790
This explains the cops coming down
on me like a ton of bricks.

00:24:05.530 --> 00:24:07.600
You're sure this isn't
you, sweetie?

00:24:07.600 --> 00:24:09.730
Uh-huh, that's not me.

00:24:09.730 --> 00:24:12.310
But she'd already been
kidnapped by that time...

00:24:12.310 --> 00:24:14.030
and was wearing these
same clothes...

00:24:14.030 --> 00:24:16.320
That bastard from last night was
either one of the kidnappers...

00:24:16.320 --> 00:24:17.800
or else Mr. Big himself.

00:24:19.340 --> 00:24:20.890
Hello! Yeah, it's me...

00:24:21.520 --> 00:24:22.480
Oh...?

00:24:22.480 --> 00:24:23.360
Uh-huh...

00:24:23.360 --> 00:24:25.150
I see... All right... Thanks.

00:24:26.240 --> 00:24:26.770
Sweetie?

00:24:27.600 --> 00:24:29.940
You said you don't know
any guards named Morris, right?

00:24:29.940 --> 00:24:30.790
Uh-huh.

00:24:30.790 --> 00:24:31.750
So he <i>is</i> involved?

00:24:31.750 --> 00:24:33.410
Yeah. That was the Fixer.

00:24:33.410 --> 00:24:35.720
He said there were no dead
bodies in the office.

00:24:35.720 --> 00:24:36.360
Which means...

00:24:36.360 --> 00:24:38.350
He played dead and split!

00:24:38.350 --> 00:24:39.210
Hey!

00:24:39.210 --> 00:24:42.950
The guards said there was a
$2 million payoff this morning.

00:24:42.950 --> 00:24:47.210
They foisted her off on us as a decoy
while they made their getaway.

00:24:47.210 --> 00:24:49.690
With $2 million!

00:24:49.690 --> 00:24:51.670
Yep, with $2 million!

00:24:52.070 --> 00:24:53.200
$2 million?!

00:24:53.200 --> 00:24:54.160
That's right!

00:24:55.440 --> 00:24:57.030
How do we find them?

00:24:57.030 --> 00:24:58.710
Good question...

00:24:58.710 --> 00:24:59.850
I'm hungry.

00:24:59.850 --> 00:25:01.220
Is the pudding here yet?

00:25:06.840 --> 00:25:10.110
I'm telling you, Bean, it's your fault
for getting caught by that camera!

00:25:10.110 --> 00:25:12.010
What should I have done?

00:25:12.010 --> 00:25:14.820
The road was blocked! It was the
only way I could get through!

00:25:14.820 --> 00:25:17.040
Then you should've
gone over it!

00:25:17.040 --> 00:25:19.330
There was a big rig
blocking the road!

00:25:19.330 --> 00:25:20.270
What's that?

00:25:20.270 --> 00:25:22.970
It's a big trailer, an 18-wheeler.

00:25:22.970 --> 00:25:24.790
It was blocking the
whole damn road!

00:25:29.740 --> 00:25:32.650
Hey, maybe it was one
of the kidnappers...

00:25:32.650 --> 00:25:34.860
Makes sense, now that
I think about it.

00:25:34.860 --> 00:25:36.050
What kind of
truck was it?

00:25:36.050 --> 00:25:40.280
I think it was a Scania,
a red one...

00:25:40.280 --> 00:25:40.990
Eh...?

00:25:40.990 --> 00:25:42.770
There! Just
like that one!

00:25:42.770 --> 00:25:45.500
It was the same colour, and the
long side was facing us...

00:25:45.500 --> 00:25:47.230
and the cop cars
smashed into it...

00:25:48.420 --> 00:25:49.980
<i>That</i> truck! Rally!
Shoot!

00:25:49.980 --> 00:25:50.860
What?

00:25:50.860 --> 00:25:52.950
That's the truck I'm talking about!
The one from last night!

00:25:52.950 --> 00:25:54.430
Oh, really!

00:26:01.250 --> 00:26:02.790
Bean?! Son of a bitch!

00:26:06.160 --> 00:26:09.880
Using the same truck for both
the trap and the getaway...

00:26:09.880 --> 00:26:11.380
What a bunch of idiots!

00:26:12.270 --> 00:26:15.460
You don't make me look like a criminal
and escape with a slap on the wrist!

00:26:15.460 --> 00:26:17.630
I'm gonna make mincemeat out of you!

00:26:17.970 --> 00:26:19.770
Stay cool.

00:26:19.770 --> 00:26:21.410
It's okay to get wild...

00:26:21.410 --> 00:26:24.350
so long as you don't send that
$2 million up in smoke.

00:26:24.350 --> 00:26:26.010
I know, I know.

00:26:26.010 --> 00:26:27.690
I'm going to get every last cent!

00:26:28.190 --> 00:26:29.820
The big prize should be in
the trailer.

00:26:29.820 --> 00:26:30.830
I'll unhook it!

00:26:30.830 --> 00:26:31.720
Hey, wait!

00:26:31.720 --> 00:26:33.600
The accelerator will stay put! Take the wheel!

00:26:39.800 --> 00:26:40.850
Bean!

00:26:45.940 --> 00:26:47.220
That was too much, you idiot!

00:26:47.220 --> 00:26:47.780
Oh, sorry...

00:26:47.780 --> 00:26:48.630
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:26:48.630 --> 00:26:50.410
<i>I thought the trailer was
going to get wiped out!</i>

00:26:50.410 --> 00:26:52.630
That Roadbuster clown
has found us!

00:26:52.630 --> 00:26:54.420
Things are going to get
bumpy, so hang on!

00:26:58.050 --> 00:26:59.470
You're not getting away!

00:27:03.640 --> 00:27:04.350
Oh shit!

00:27:11.230 --> 00:27:12.570
Damn!

00:27:23.370 --> 00:27:25.830
Screw it! If it's come
down to this, then...

00:27:25.830 --> 00:27:28.590
Come on! Faster!
They're gaining on us!

00:27:28.590 --> 00:27:32.270
Well, I'll tell you...
I've got an ace-in-the-hole.

00:27:32.270 --> 00:27:34.770
Get my bag up off the floor!

00:27:34.770 --> 00:27:36.360
Hey, where is it?

00:27:37.300 --> 00:27:38.770
Sorry about that...

00:27:46.430 --> 00:27:48.390
Idiots! That's a dead end!

00:27:49.710 --> 00:27:52.350
Rick's dead. We're
getting out in this.

00:27:54.790 --> 00:27:56.520
Are they that desperate?

00:27:59.880 --> 00:28:00.860
Bean! Hit the brakes!

00:28:11.680 --> 00:28:12.620
That did it!

00:28:30.940 --> 00:28:32.310
Shit!

00:28:31.280 --> 00:28:32.310
<i>Damn!</i>

00:28:34.800 --> 00:28:36.000
Hey! Where are you...?

00:28:36.000 --> 00:28:37.430
They'll get us if we stay
on the highway!

00:28:37.430 --> 00:28:39.190
We'll lose them in the city!

00:28:41.260 --> 00:28:44.340
Well, that was fun, Mr. Morris.

00:28:44.340 --> 00:28:46.160
Now it's my turn!

00:28:46.790 --> 00:28:50.300
Hey, Bean! Our little princess seems
to have passed out again.

00:28:50.300 --> 00:28:51.250
I like it quiet.

00:28:52.030 --> 00:28:55.460
Now I can settle down and collect
that $2 million, with interest.

00:28:55.860 --> 00:28:56.710
Interest?

00:28:56.710 --> 00:28:58.420
The bastards' lives!

00:29:09.130 --> 00:29:12.610
Inspector, please don't
be so angry!

00:29:12.610 --> 00:29:16.450
You were right in front of him, so
there was nothing we could do!

00:29:16.450 --> 00:29:19.440
If anyone had fired, you
might have been hit!

00:29:19.440 --> 00:29:20.470
Shut up!

00:29:20.470 --> 00:29:23.870
I spared no effort to
hunt up this Cobra!

00:29:23.870 --> 00:29:26.860
I also invested no small amount of
time and money in restoring it!

00:29:26.860 --> 00:29:29.830
And because of my incompetent
subordinates, it gets wasted!

00:29:30.170 --> 00:29:32.090
I'd have to be nuts not to
be royally pissed off!

00:29:32.090 --> 00:29:34.610
Listen! Screw up like this again...

00:29:32.780 --> 00:29:35.670
<i>Zebra 6, come in... Zebra 6, come in...</i>

00:29:34.610 --> 00:29:35.670
and I'll bash your head in!

00:29:37.010 --> 00:29:38.570
<i>This is Zebra 6. What is it?</i>

00:29:38.570 --> 00:29:39.630
Uh, yes, sir!

00:29:39.630 --> 00:29:42.010
<i>We've located the Roadbuster.</i>

00:29:42.010 --> 00:29:43.120
What?!

00:29:43.120 --> 00:29:46.310
<i>He's proceeding east on
Grand Avenue at high speed.</i>

00:29:46.310 --> 00:29:49.760
Isn't Grand Avenue...?

00:29:59.160 --> 00:30:00.230
All right!

00:30:06.340 --> 00:30:07.160
One more time!

00:30:22.540 --> 00:30:24.690
Roadbuster...!

00:30:27.640 --> 00:30:28.840
Shove it, asshole!

00:30:29.690 --> 00:30:30.550
That hurt, shithead!

00:30:38.810 --> 00:30:40.520
Wait a second.

00:30:40.520 --> 00:30:41.830
This is a ten-gauge solid slug!

00:30:41.830 --> 00:30:43.480
They use these at roadblocks!

00:30:43.850 --> 00:30:45.580
Calling all cars!

00:30:45.580 --> 00:30:47.890
The suspects are
heading west on Hubbard!

00:30:47.890 --> 00:30:50.540
Block the road with your cars
if you have to, but stop them!

00:30:52.710 --> 00:30:54.170
They've passed through
La Salle Street!

00:30:54.170 --> 00:30:56.200
Haul ass! Whatever you do,
don't lose them!

00:30:56.570 --> 00:30:58.410
Rally! We're going to take
them out in one shot!

00:30:58.940 --> 00:31:00.840
I'll swing around to their left!

00:31:00.840 --> 00:31:02.880
You blow a hole through their engine!

00:31:03.430 --> 00:31:06.070
Do you think a KTW .44 Magnum
will be sufficient?

00:31:06.070 --> 00:31:07.090
Excellent!

00:31:12.770 --> 00:31:15.240
No good, Inspector!
They got away!

00:31:15.240 --> 00:31:17.310
I know that already!
Get out of the way!

00:31:33.660 --> 00:31:34.620
Okay! Fire!

00:31:34.620 --> 00:31:36.410
No! My Papa's in that car!

00:31:36.990 --> 00:31:38.000
Rally...!

00:31:38.000 --> 00:31:38.960
Sorry!

00:31:40.250 --> 00:31:42.460
Never underestimate
a V12 engine!

00:31:43.070 --> 00:31:45.460
A drag race through the heart of
downtown? I like your style!

00:31:52.510 --> 00:31:53.930
Shit!

00:31:53.930 --> 00:31:56.890
Yeah, that V12 really
hangs tough!

00:32:13.820 --> 00:32:14.780
Slowpoke!

00:32:24.080 --> 00:32:26.010
We've lost the Roadbuster.

00:32:26.010 --> 00:32:29.460
Cars not involved in the accident,
search the Wells Street area.

00:32:29.460 --> 00:32:31.550
Where's Percy? What
happened to him?

00:32:31.550 --> 00:32:33.980
His car, as well as those of several citizens
have apparently been reduced to scrap!

00:32:33.980 --> 00:32:35.640
This ain't a sideshow, you idiots!

00:32:47.310 --> 00:32:48.360
Bean!

00:32:49.000 --> 00:32:50.480
Watch the kid.

00:32:50.480 --> 00:32:51.360
All right.

00:32:52.810 --> 00:32:53.810
Uh...

00:32:54.480 --> 00:32:57.330
That man... He will save
my papa, won't he?

00:32:57.860 --> 00:32:59.400
He's going after the bad guys...

00:32:59.400 --> 00:33:00.790
So he's a good guy, right?

00:33:01.400 --> 00:33:03.250
Really, is that what he
looks like to you?

00:33:05.580 --> 00:33:06.570
It's all right.

00:33:06.570 --> 00:33:09.150
He's a scoundrel at heart, but he
dreams of being the good guy.

00:33:10.810 --> 00:33:13.590
So he watches at least two films a
week with heroic things in them.

00:33:21.700 --> 00:33:23.600
<i>You live up to your reputation,
Bean Bandit.</i>

00:33:24.120 --> 00:33:27.570
<i>I'm amazed that you found me...
I didn't think you'd drive me to this.</i>

00:33:28.110 --> 00:33:29.570
A woman...?

00:33:29.570 --> 00:33:33.100
Last night's setup was really something,
wouldn't you say?

00:33:33.100 --> 00:33:34.450
<i>What are you talking about?</i>

00:33:34.450 --> 00:33:36.030
<i>You used the same trailer
for your getaway...</i>

00:33:36.530 --> 00:33:38.530
that you used to block the street.

00:33:38.530 --> 00:33:41.050
You're just amateurs, after all.

00:33:41.050 --> 00:33:43.100
Your finding us was just
a coincidence, right?

00:33:44.040 --> 00:33:46.790
I've already hidden the
money in another car.

00:33:46.790 --> 00:33:50.500
Even it you kill me, the cops
will find it before you do.

00:33:50.500 --> 00:33:52.830
Well? Want to make a deal?

00:33:52.830 --> 00:33:56.220
With your car and my hostage,
we could make it to Mexico.

00:33:56.630 --> 00:33:59.690
You'll get a $500 thousand shipping fee.

00:33:59.690 --> 00:34:02.180
If you want to escape, I'll help you all I can.

00:34:02.180 --> 00:34:03.050
What do you say?

00:34:03.050 --> 00:34:07.900
I'm hoping for the $2 million,
the hostage, and your lives...

00:34:08.510 --> 00:34:09.830
The works!

00:34:39.160 --> 00:34:40.430
He can't be human!

00:34:48.820 --> 00:34:50.740
Be quiet! Okay?

00:35:02.700 --> 00:35:03.780
Freeze!

00:35:03.780 --> 00:35:05.790
Don't get any smart ideas!

00:35:05.790 --> 00:35:08.870
I've got a Python pointed at the brat's
head, with the hammer cocked!

00:35:10.030 --> 00:35:13.840
Throw your gun over to me
so it won't be a problem!

00:35:14.490 --> 00:35:16.700
I can't just meekly go along with
whatever you tell me to do.

00:35:16.700 --> 00:35:19.130
That's your partner in
disguise, isn't it?

00:35:19.130 --> 00:35:23.010
I don't care what you think! Throw me
your gun or I'll blow her brains out!

00:35:23.510 --> 00:35:25.970
At this point, I'm desperate
enough to do it!

00:35:31.440 --> 00:35:34.440
All right. We can't escape you.

00:35:34.440 --> 00:35:35.910
I'll make it $1 million.

00:35:35.910 --> 00:35:37.650
With that you could
even build a house in Tokyo!

00:35:41.110 --> 00:35:42.580
Okay, $1.1 million.

00:35:42.580 --> 00:35:44.110
$1.2 million!

00:35:44.110 --> 00:35:46.330
You've got nothing to gain
by fighting any further!

00:35:51.910 --> 00:35:52.860
No, stop it!

00:35:52.860 --> 00:35:55.750
Please, stop! We'll
give you the whole $2 million!

00:35:55.750 --> 00:35:58.710
Stay out of this,
you little brat!

00:36:00.170 --> 00:36:00.970
Freeze!

00:36:06.140 --> 00:36:08.800
Right. You stay just like that.

00:36:08.800 --> 00:36:09.850
Drop the knife.

00:36:09.850 --> 00:36:12.310
Thinking of making a friend
into a hostage?

00:36:12.310 --> 00:36:13.740
I just did.

00:36:13.740 --> 00:36:16.250
What matters to you is
not whether it's friend or foe...

00:36:16.250 --> 00:36:17.270
but whether or not it's a kid.

00:36:19.040 --> 00:36:20.490
Bean Bandit...

00:36:20.490 --> 00:36:23.940
I checked you out very carefully.

00:36:23.940 --> 00:36:25.700
You're a true monster.

00:36:25.700 --> 00:36:28.410
You should have changed your plans
when you figured that out.

00:36:28.410 --> 00:36:29.620
Hardly.

00:36:29.620 --> 00:36:32.290
You have a serious flaw...

00:36:33.160 --> 00:36:35.240
your soft spot for kids.

00:36:35.240 --> 00:36:37.340
The fact that you're just standing
there proves it...

00:36:38.120 --> 00:36:39.300
Drop it!

00:36:44.260 --> 00:36:45.260
Idiot.

00:36:58.830 --> 00:36:59.280
Semmer!

00:37:01.950 --> 00:37:03.340
Hurry it up!

00:37:07.860 --> 00:37:10.080
All right. I'll throw it, okay?

00:37:10.460 --> 00:37:13.640
I like a sensible girl.

00:37:13.640 --> 00:37:17.620
Use your left hand, and
hold it by the barrel.

00:37:17.620 --> 00:37:19.040
That's it.

00:37:19.490 --> 00:37:22.260
Ah-ah! Put your right hand
on top of your head!

00:38:06.720 --> 00:38:08.380
Throw it! Quick!

00:38:24.800 --> 00:38:26.210
Stop it, already!

00:38:26.210 --> 00:38:28.360
I'll tell you which
car we hid the money in!

00:38:28.360 --> 00:38:29.370
Carrie!

00:38:29.790 --> 00:38:31.370
We're no match for him!

00:38:31.370 --> 00:38:33.410
Please! I'll tell you where
it is if you let us go!

00:38:33.410 --> 00:38:35.370
We'll never work
here again!

00:38:36.300 --> 00:38:37.080
Deal.

00:38:37.080 --> 00:38:39.540
In the third row from the north
side, right near the centre...

00:38:39.540 --> 00:38:41.000
there's a Benz wagon.

00:38:41.000 --> 00:38:41.730
It's a silver–

00:38:41.730 --> 00:38:42.550
Carrie!

00:38:42.550 --> 00:38:43.500
No!

00:38:48.410 --> 00:38:49.390
Semmer!

00:38:52.600 --> 00:38:55.620
All cars present! We've blocked
off the entire north entrance!

00:38:55.620 --> 00:38:56.400
What about the civilians?

00:38:56.400 --> 00:38:58.000
They've all been evacuated!

00:38:59.740 --> 00:39:02.400
Inspector, why don't we
just charge in there?

00:39:02.400 --> 00:39:06.030
With this many men, he
wouldn't last a second!

00:39:06.030 --> 00:39:07.610
Charge?

00:39:09.780 --> 00:39:12.030
I wouldn't go to all this trouble if regular
tactics worked against him!

00:39:13.740 --> 00:39:15.470
That takes care of that.

00:39:15.470 --> 00:39:16.360
Will you be all right?

00:39:16.360 --> 00:39:17.980
The police are covering the exit...

00:39:17.980 --> 00:39:21.090
The main thing on my mind right now
isn't all the patrol cars out there...

00:39:21.090 --> 00:39:23.870
but rather, “What am I going
to eat for dinner?”

00:39:23.870 --> 00:39:27.550
Now are you sure this is okay, paying
me the $2 million and all?

00:39:30.200 --> 00:39:31.260
It's a bargain.

00:39:31.570 --> 00:39:33.820
Call me up anytime
you need me.

00:39:33.820 --> 00:39:35.720
I'll give you a discount
next time around.

00:39:49.030 --> 00:39:49.820
Hey there.

00:39:53.300 --> 00:39:55.530
The street is crawling
with police.

00:39:55.530 --> 00:39:56.640
Want a lift?

00:39:56.640 --> 00:40:00.250
Since you helped us get the loot,
I'll give you a lift for free.

00:40:01.190 --> 00:40:02.690
Now, now...

00:40:02.690 --> 00:40:04.210
I've still got two shots left.

00:40:04.210 --> 00:40:05.500
Cut it out.

00:40:05.500 --> 00:40:08.300
A lollipop would look
better on you than a .45.

00:40:09.050 --> 00:40:10.890
Semmerling is dead.

00:40:10.890 --> 00:40:13.390
How come only you survived?

00:40:13.390 --> 00:40:15.020
You saying it's my fault?

00:40:15.020 --> 00:40:15.760
Damn right I am!

00:40:16.700 --> 00:40:18.710
As much as it hurts...

00:40:19.240 --> 00:40:21.770
you know good and well why
the fuel blew up, don't you?

00:40:30.300 --> 00:40:32.910
Come out, Roadbuster!

00:40:32.910 --> 00:40:35.380
You scared of me?
Chickening out?

00:40:35.380 --> 00:40:37.530
Give me a break!

00:40:37.530 --> 00:40:39.870
Hey, she's out like a light.

00:40:40.370 --> 00:40:41.910
I bet she's exhausted.

00:40:41.910 --> 00:40:45.810
Honestly, since when did the back
of this car become a crib?

00:40:45.810 --> 00:40:48.160
Do you suppose it'll be harder
for us to stay in this town?

00:40:48.160 --> 00:40:49.050
Want to move?

00:40:49.740 --> 00:40:50.950
Don't be silly!

00:40:50.950 --> 00:40:53.760
Big-hearted rich
guys, out-and-out slimeballs...

00:40:54.160 --> 00:40:59.830
Come out and play, Roadbuster!
Come out and play, Roadbuster!

00:40:59.830 --> 00:41:01.230
Louder!

00:41:01.560 --> 00:41:03.190
and these crazy cops...

00:41:02.060 --> 00:41:05.550
<i>Come out, Roadbuster!</i>

00:41:03.680 --> 00:41:07.090
we can still have fun in this town!
